    "Termind does not attach terminal output, chat content, passwords, or private keys to diagnostic data." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind does not attach terminal output, chat content, passwords, or private keys to diagnostic data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind不会在诊断数据中附加终端输出、聊天内容、密码或私钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind不會在診斷資料中附加終端輸出、聊天內容、密碼或私鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Termind returns only a one-shot handle to the MCP client. The value is bound to this session, destination, ssh_exec, and purpose." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind只向MCP客户端返回一次性句柄。该值绑定到当前会话、目标、ssh_exec和用途。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Termind只向MCP使用者端返回一次性控制代碼。該值繫結到目前工作階段、目標、ssh_exec和用途。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Termind uses [Ghostty](https://ghostty.org) as its terminal engine. Custom configuration uses [Ghostty's configuration format](https://ghostty.org/docs/config/reference)." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
